        <item>
            <title>3.4.4</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 10:41:29 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/sj719045032/claude-statistics</link>
            <sparkle:version>3.4.4</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.4.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's New
- Added hook-based plugin recommendations for missing terminal integrations.
- Reworked the plugin marketplace so recommendations, installed plugins, and categories are shown as lightweight tabs.
- Improved subscription account display and CLI status line behavior for app-managed subscriptions.
- Fixed GLM subscription usage and dashboard routing edge cases.

## 中文
- 新增基于 hook 的终端插件推荐，在缺少 Ghostty 等集成插件时提示安装。
- 调整插件市场交互，将推荐、已安装和分类统一为轻量 tab，并保留已安装插件的管理功能。
- 优化订阅账号展示，以及 Claude CLI status line 对 app-managed 订阅的显示逻辑。
- 修复 GLM 订阅用量展示和 dashboard 跳转相关问题。
]]></description>
